{"id":"b2fa45baaddb4aa3","group":"17","path":"17/17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding.md","title":"Diagonal Elementary Embedding into an Ultrapower","display":"cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding — Diagonal Elementary Embedding into an Ultrapower","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding","aliases":["17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding"],"display":"cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding — Diagonal Elementary Embedding into an Ultrapower","depends_on":["[[17-thm-los]]","[[17-df-ultrapower]]","[[17-df-ultrafilter]]","[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]","[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"statement-and-source-proof-compared; diagonal function construction explicit","source_section":"4.1","source_result":"natural embedding; Corollary 4.1.13","source_pages_print":[221],"source_pages_djvu":[237],"legacy_label":"17-cor-4.3.2","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding — Diagonal Elementary Embedding into an Ultrapower"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b51a9d2d7c819846\" href=\"?note=b51a9d2d7c819846\" title=\"17-thm-los\">17-thm-los</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbcb80a62faf05ea\" href=\"?note=bbcb80a62faf05ea\" title=\"17-df-ultrapower\">17-df-ultrapower</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9e920083cdf9b067\" href=\"?note=9e920083cdf9b067\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilter\">17-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"16340c2187670288\" href=\"?note=16340c2187670288\" title=\"17-df-elementary-embedding\">17-df-elementary-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-and-source-proof-compared; diagonal function construction explicit"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"natural embedding; Corollary 4.1.13"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>221</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>237</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-cor-4.3.2"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b51a9d2d7c819846\" href=\"?note=b51a9d2d7c819846\" title=\"17-thm-los\">17-thm-los</a> 的 ZFC 元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 上的超滤子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak B)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bbcb80a62faf05ea\" href=\"?note=bbcb80a62faf05ea\" title=\"17-df-ultrapower\">17-df-ultrapower</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f]_U\">\\([f]_U\\)</span> 为该超幂的商类记号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\">\\(\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"16340c2187670288\" href=\"?note=16340c2187670288\" title=\"17-df-elementary-embedding\">17-df-elementary-embedding</a> 的初等嵌入集合。以下为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span> 定义常值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_a\">\\(c_a\\)</span> 并定义函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nc_a&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(i,a):i\\in I\\}\\quad(a\\in|\\mathfrak A|),\\\\\nd&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(a,[c_a]_U):a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\},\\\\\nd&amp;\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nc_a&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(i,a):i\\in I\\}\\quad(a\\in|\\mathfrak A|),\\\\\nd&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(a,[c_a]_U):a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\},\\\\\nd&amp;\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书自然嵌入定义及推论4.1.13，印刷 p.221（DjVu 237）；已核对书中证明。常值函数是合法乘积元素，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 对应唯一商类，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span> 的函数。对任意有限元组与公式应用 Łoś 定理，右侧真值集合只能是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span>，超滤子只包含前者，得到初等性。每个公式只有有限个自由变量，因此有限元组陈述与上游总赋值接口等价。这里形式定义了具体自然映射，而非仅假设存在一个被称为对角映射的函数；结论不要求原载体与商载体字面包含。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-thm-los","status":"resolved","id":"b51a9d2d7c819846","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-thm-los]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrapower","status":"resolved","id":"bbcb80a62faf05ea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrapower]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"16340c2187670288","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-tuple-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ec60741c4296112","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-thm-los","status":"resolved","id":"b51a9d2d7c819846","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 [[17-thm-los]] 的 ZFC 元理论中，$\\mathfrak A$ 为 $L$-结构，$I$ 是非空集合，$U$ 为 $I$ 上的超滤子。$\\mathfrak B$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak B)$，见 [[17-df-ultrapower]]。$[f]_U$ 为该超幂的商类记号。$\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 为 [[17-df-elementary-embedding]] 的初等嵌入集合。以下为每个 $a\\in|\\mathfrak A|$ 定义常值函数 $c_a$ 并定义函数 $d$。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrapower","status":"resolved","id":"bbcb80a62faf05ea","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 [[17-thm-los]] 的 ZFC 元理论中，$\\mathfrak A$ 为 $L$-结构，$I$ 是非空集合，$U$ 为 $I$ 上的超滤子。$\\mathfrak B$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak B)$，见 [[17-df-ultrapower]]。$[f]_U$ 为该超幂的商类记号。$\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 为 [[17-df-elementary-embedding]] 的初等嵌入集合。以下为每个 $a\\in|\\mathfrak A|$ 定义常值函数 $c_a$ 并定义函数 $d$。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"16340c2187670288","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 [[17-thm-los]] 的 ZFC 元理论中，$\\mathfrak A$ 为 $L$-结构，$I$ 是非空集合，$U$ 为 $I$ 上的超滤子。$\\mathfrak B$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak B)$，见 [[17-df-ultrapower]]。$[f]_U$ 为该超幂的商类记号。$\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 为 [[17-df-elementary-embedding]] 的初等嵌入集合。以下为每个 $a\\in|\\mathfrak A|$ 定义常值函数 $c_a$ 并定义函数 $d$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak B)","display":false},{"tex":"[f]_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"c_a","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nc_a&\\coloneqq\\{(i,a):i\\in I\\}\\quad(a\\in|\\mathfrak A|),\\\\\nd&\\coloneqq\\{(a,[c_a]_U):a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\},\\\\\nd&\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":2245,"backlinks":[{"id":"14765bedc096a21d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"在超积构造所用的 ZFC 元理论中，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$I$ 为非空集合，$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)$，见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。超幂谓词与初等嵌入集合分别见 [[17-df-ultrapower]]、[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]。自然映射的构造和初等性见 [[17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding]]。"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-243","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-cor-dense-linear-order-complete]]\n[[17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding]]"},{"id":"0b9cf711d9f53336","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding|17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding]]"}],"outgoing":["b51a9d2d7c819846","bbcb80a62faf05ea","9e920083cdf9b067","16340c2187670288","4ec60741c4296112"]}